.TH SOCKET 2
.SH NAME
socket \- create a local socket
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B #include <sys/socket.h>
.PP
.B int socket(int domain, int type, int protocol);
.SH DESCRIPTION
Astia supports AF_UNIX SOCK_STREAM and SOCK_DGRAM sockets with protocol zero.
Datagram sockets use bounded kernel queues and never use host networking.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns a descriptor, or -1 and sets errno.
